'''Bouncing Four''' (４人でぴょんぴょん, ''4 Nin de Pyonpyon'', '''Hopping with Four''') is a 2-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 4.0 Update|Version 4.0]] and is unlocked after completing [[Into the Future]] Chapter 1.

==Effect==
Starting Money UP (M): Wallet starts with 500¢.

